      "number": "294",
      "text": "294. \u5316\u7b80\uff1a\na) $\\left(-\\frac{16x^{4n+7}}{y^3}\\right)\\div\\left(\\frac{8x^{3n+5}}{y^2}\\right)$\uff1b\nb) $\\left(\\frac{81a^{4n-1}}{25}\\right)^3\\cdot\\left(\\frac{5}{27a^{3n-1}}\\right)^4$.",
